      "system": {
        "description": "<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">TheMister Gutsy has 360&deg; vision, and improved sensory systems that can detect smells, chemicals, and radiation, reducing the difficulty of </span><strong><span class=\"fontstyle2\">PER </span></strong><span class=\"fontstyle0\">tests that rely on sight and smell by 1. It moves through jet propulsion, hovering above the ground, unaffected by difficult terrain or obstacles.</span></p>",
